      "content": "thanks for the reply. i've had migraines before but this feels totally different. it just feels like a physical blow to the head. my neck is starting to feel really stiff too, kind of like i can't look down properly. i don't really want to go to the hospital if i don't have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. do you think it could just be a tension headache or maybe i just need some extra ibuprofen and to lie down in a dark room?",
